{"tmdb":1591675,"tagline":"\"Keep your eyes on my back and you'll grow too.\"","synopsis":"Popular, outgoing Fujino is celebrated by her classmates for her funny comics in the class newspaper. One day, her teacher asks her to share the space with Kyomoto, a truant recluse whose beautiful artwork sparks a competitive fervor in Fujino. What starts as jealousy transforms when Fujino realizes their shared passion for drawing.","directors":[{"name":"Hirokazu Kore-eda","id":25645}],"cast":[{"actor":"Natsuki Deguchi","role":"Fujino","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/59JqUapkBrxL8IPQCAI7Rvq6azy.jpg","tmdb":2222685},{"actor":"Aju Makita","role":"Kyomoto","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1ytWQPDRZZVb8enAc0Kp4mRkbJL.jpg","tmdb":1669110},{"actor":"Fuuri Nanase","role":"Young Fujino","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/a63bRYidublBCBCJZTLILxsufd.jpg","tmdb":6273074},{"actor":"Rokka Okada","role":"Young Kyomoto","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yNjprZM1tgebW4iNtizEQCWMDQ8.jpg","tmdb":6273076},{"actor":"Masaki Suda","role":"Maeda","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/g7gXu0bE9jZ5LHjSqn1zHdNtiA1.jpg","tmdb":585211},{"actor":"Kankuro Kudo","role":"Tamai","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1cIforKuSiewIYTuH9WKQXUsguu.jpg","tmdb":87661},{"actor":"Kayo Noro","role":"Akari","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7yVoln6lLAidsVKS02LKjiAoCed.jpg","tmdb":1744395},{"actor":"Ryo Ikeda","role":"Hitoshi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6FLErP2cGnLr8sBw2Zi3ThLerjY.jpg","tmdb":1851071},{"actor":"Miyu Sasaki","role":"Megumi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AkMmdf9nA6LG9WY1XAOfznSzv7v.jpg","tmdb":1980043},{"actor":"Maho Yamada","role":"Manabe","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oDHXLA6wsJRBWwQrRGM062p3ThU.jpg","tmdb":1063266}],"trailers":[{"key":"ILBDFlYMGAY","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","type":"Trailer","published":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"5R3EQMrVjt0","name":"Official Trailer [ENG SUB]","type":"Trailer","published":"2026-07-23